#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:131
msgid ""
"Community SH es un panel para desplegar y administrar instancias de Odoo y "
"otras aplicaciones sobre Docker. Cada instancia tiene su propia base de "
"datos, dominio, SSL y backups, y todo se gestiona desde el navegador."
msgstr "Community SH is a dashboard to deploy and manage Odoo instances and other apps on Docker. Each instance has its own database, domain, SSL and backups, all managed from the browser."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:139
msgid "Crear cuenta"
msgstr "Create account"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:156
msgid "Apps listas"
msgstr "Ready apps"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:160
msgid "Licencia"
msgstr "License"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:174
#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/project_detail.html:79
msgid "Instancias"
msgstr "Instances"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:203
msgid "Tareas recientes"
msgstr "Recent tasks"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:219
msgid "Todo lo que necesitas para operar Odoo"
msgstr "Everything you need to run Odoo"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:220
msgid "Del primer despliegue a los backups diarios, sin entrar al servidor."
msgstr "From the first deploy to daily backups, without logging into the server."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:227
msgid "Despliega en minutos"
msgstr "Deploy in minutes"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:229
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Odoo %(first)s a %(last)s aislado, con su propio Postgres, red Docker y "
"volumen de datos."
msgstr "Isolated Odoo %(first)s to %(last)s, with its own Postgres, Docker network and data volume."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:234
msgid "Uno o varios repositorios de GitHub por instancia"
msgstr "One or more GitHub repositories per instance"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:235
msgid "Duplica para staging con sus datos y adjuntos"
msgstr "Duplicate for staging with its data and attachments"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:236
msgid "Entra como admin sin escribir la contraseña"
msgstr "Log in as admin without typing the password"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:241
msgid "Tus datos, a salvo"
msgstr "Your data, safe"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:242
msgid ""
"Respaldos con base de datos y filestore, manuales o programados con "
"retención."
msgstr ""
"Backups with database and filestore, manual or scheduled with retention. "
"Restore, or create a new instance from any backup."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:244
msgid "Restaura o crea una instancia desde cualquier backup"
msgstr "Restore or create an instance from any backup"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:245
msgid "Importa los backups nativos de Odoo"
msgstr "Import Odoo's native backups"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:246
msgid "Cada usuario ve solo lo suyo; 2FA y bloqueo por intentos"
msgstr "Each user sees only their own; 2FA and lockout after failed attempts"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:251
msgid "Dominios y HTTPS automáticos"
msgstr "Automatic domains and HTTPS"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:252
msgid ""
"Traefik enruta cada dominio y Let's Encrypt emite y renueva los certificados."
msgstr "Traefik routes every domain and Let's Encrypt issues and renews the certificates."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:254
msgid "Un subdominio por instancia: cliente-20-bd.tudominio.com"
msgstr "A subdomain per instance: client-20-db.yourdomain.com"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:255
msgid "Dominios propios para instancias y apps"
msgstr "Custom domains for instances and apps"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:256
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s apps listas para lanzar junto a tu ERP"
msgstr "%(count)s apps ready to launch next to your ERP"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:261
msgid "Automatiza con IA y API"
msgstr "Automate with AI and API"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:262
msgid ""
"Pide cambios a la IA en el chat de cada instancia, conecta Claude por MCP o "
"usa la API REST."
msgstr "Ask the AI for changes in each instance's chat, connect Claude over MCP or use the REST API."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:264
msgid "Módulos y cambios generados por IA, con deshacer"
msgstr "AI-generated modules and changes, with undo"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:265
msgid "Tareas en segundo plano con su progreso"
msgstr "Background tasks with their progress"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:266
msgid "Logs, consola y métricas de CPU y RAM"
msgstr "Logs, console and CPU and RAM metrics"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:280
msgid "Catálogo"
msgstr "Catalog"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:281
msgid "Apps a un clic"
msgstr "One-click apps"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:283
msgid "Plantillas YAML que puedes ajustar o ampliar en"
msgstr "YAML templates you can tweak or extend in"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:302
msgid "Un servidor, todo en Docker"
msgstr "One server, everything in Docker"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:303
msgid ""
"El panel habla con Docker en tu servidor. No hay servicios externos ni "
"agentes que instalar."
msgstr "The dashboard talks to Docker on your server. No external services or agents to install."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:310
msgid ""
"Recibe el tráfico en los puertos 80/443, aplica el SSL y lo dirige por "
"dominio."
msgstr "Receives traffic on ports 80/443, terminates SSL and routes it by domain."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:316
msgid "Interfaz web y API. Encola las operaciones largas."
msgstr "Web interface and API. Queues long operations."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:320
msgid "Despliega, respalda y restaura. Lanza los backups programados."
msgstr "Deploys, backs up and restores. Runs the scheduled backups."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:328
msgid "Instancia «mi-empresa»"
msgstr "Instance “my-company”"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:329
msgid "Odoo + Postgres en su propia red, filestore en un volumen."
msgstr "Odoo + Postgres on their own network, filestore in a volume."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:336
msgid ""
"La base de datos del panel vive en una red interna a la que las instancias "
"no tienen acceso."
msgstr "The dashboard's database lives on an internal network that instances cannot reach."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:348
msgid "En marcha en minutos"
msgstr "Up and running in minutes"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:356
msgid "Un servidor Linux"
msgstr "A Linux server"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:357
msgid ""
"Con acceso root y los puertos 80 y 443 libres. El instalador se encarga de "
"Docker."
msgstr "With root access and ports 80 and 443 free. The installer takes care of Docker."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:361
msgid "Configura el DNS antes"
msgstr "Set up DNS first"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:362
msgid ""
"Crea los registros A de tudominio.com y *.tudominio.com apuntando a la IP "
"del servidor. El instalador te pedirá el dominio y un email, y Traefik "
"genera los certificados HTTPS."
msgstr "Create A records for yourdomain.com and *.yourdomain.com pointing to the server's IP. The installer asks for the domain and an email, and Traefik issues the HTTPS certificates."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:366
msgid "Ejecuta el instalador"
msgstr "Run the installer"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:367
msgid "Genera las claves, configura tu dominio y levanta todos los servicios."
msgstr "It generates the keys, sets up your domain and starts every service."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:371
msgid "Crea tu primera instancia"
msgstr "Create your first instance"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:372
msgid ""
"La primera cuenta que se registra es la de administrador. Elige versión de "
"Odoo y despliega."
msgstr "The first account to sign up becomes the administrator. Pick an Odoo version and deploy."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:379
msgid ""
"Antes de ejecutarlo, comprueba que tu dominio ya apunta al servidor (por "
"ejemplo con «dig +short tudominio.com»). El instalador lo verifica y te "
"avisa si no es así."
msgstr "Before running it, check that your domain already points to the server (e.g. with “dig +short yourdomain.com”). The installer checks it and warns you if it does not."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:384
